            "review_title": "Review at Pho An Nam",
            "review_text": "Nostratamis\nTraralgon, Australia246 contributions\n0\nJust Pho!\nFeb 2017 • Solo\nGood authentic Pho in a hurry.\nNo fuss, cheap, fresh and directly opposite my hotel.\nCannot fault it, but nothing to rave about either.\nIf you need a good bowl of Pho and you are in the area, it is as good as any (and better than the nearby \"franchises\" and their quirky claims).\nComfortable, clean and off the street.\nWill definitely return on my next visit.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 23, 2017",
